WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 37 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
I knew it! My gut never lies!

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.440
We almost kneeled to a con man in his sickly little pet!

3
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.720
I told you from the start!

4
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.120
The dragon god was just boring my body.

5
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.600
Now his power's gone, that's all!

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.720
Convenient, isn't it?

7
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.720
The Grand Duke purifies him and that power just happens to run out at the exact same second.

8
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.320
Aris is just making excuses for using dark magic!

9
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.120
The baby dragon tapped out for now, but it'll wake.

10
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.480
I have to put them both down before that happens.

11
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:29.380
The Codex!

12
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.980
You've fought in the right to hold sacred law.

13
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.060
Get out of my sight.

14
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.380
The law speaks plainly.

15
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.420
Deceiving the Rezenis Asterobe is a capital offense.

16
00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.980
Aris, you and your beast to the dungeons!

17
00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.100
Pending judgment!

18
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:46.740
I'm innocent!

19
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.620
No dark magic, no illusions, none of it!

20
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.380
Not let you murder an innocent boy!

21
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.500
Aris, let's go.

22
00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.660
Oh!

23
00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.540
Chute Valmont, this isn't your fight.

24
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.500
You don't have to do this.

25
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.160
The Astralon!

26
00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.480
It's coming apart!

27
00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:24.670
Spirit Bond Mark.

28
00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:26.990
Total resonance.

29
00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.950
The dream every dragon knight has chased for a thousand years.

30
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:32.510
Knight and dragon, one soul, one breath.

31
00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:37.790
The moment that beast wakes, he can summon every element in existence with a single thought.
